type: software
title: "Paper Factory: Evidence-First Agentic Research-Paper Production"
authors:
  - family-names: "Sakızlı"
    given-names: "Furkan"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-04"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/SKZL-AI/paper-factory"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SKZL-AI/paper-factory"
abstract: >-
  Paper Factory is a deterministic, harness-neutral orchestration system for
  evidence-first, agentic research-paper production. A research DAG (P00-P37)
  with global closure invariants (U1-U16) binds every claim to concrete
  evidence artifacts; LLM harnesses act as replaceable workers; VeriHarness/HoH
  serves as the verification kernel; irreversible release steps remain under
  human authority.
